{"created": "2023-03-08T17:09:27.927768+00:00", "modified": "2023-03-09T02:26:43.421330+00:00", "id": 7708984, "conceptrecid": "7570821", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.7708984", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.7570821", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7708984", "metadata": {"title": "Defectors: A Large Scale Python Dataset for Defect Prediction", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.7708984", "publication_date": "2023-01-26", "description": "<p>Defect prediction has been a major research problem in the software engineering domain for the last five decades.<br>\nIn recent years, large deep-learning models have shifted the performance of software engineering tasks to new limits and are gaining usage in defect prediction.<br>\nHowever, these defect prediction models are often limited by the quality of their datasets, which are not large or diverse enough.<br>\nIn this paper, we present Defectors, a large dataset for both line-level and just-in-time defect prediction.<br>\nDefectors consist of $\\approx$ 213K source code files ($\\approx$ 93K defective and $\\approx$ 120K defect-free files) from 25 popular python projects from various domains and organizations.<br>\nThese projects come from a diverse set of domains including machine learning, automation, and internet-of-things.<br>\nSuch a scale and diversity make Defectors a suitable dataset for deep learning models, especially transformer models that require large and diverse datasets to effectively generalize defect-inducing patterns to predict future defects.</p>\n\n<table>\n\t<caption>Dataset Description</caption>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>File Name</td>\n\t\t\t<td>Description</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>defectors.zip</td>\n\t\t\t<td>The original Dataset. Find its description in Section II of the paper.</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>bug_inducing_commits.zip</td>\n\t\t\t<td>Each yaml file contains a map of bugfix commits to bug-inducing commits.</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>filtered_bug_inducing_commits.yaml</td>\n\t\t\t<td>A map in structure {repo_name: {bug_inducing_commits: [list of python files in the commit]}}. This file only contains the bug-inducing commits that match the filtering criteria from Section III.D.</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>repo_links.yaml</td>\n\t\t\t<td>Links to the repositories we used to construct the dataset.</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Parvez Mahbub", "affiliation": "Dalhousie University"}, {"name": "Ohiduzzaman Shuvo", "affiliation": "Dalhousie University"}, {"name": "Mohammad Masudur Rahman", "affiliation": "Dalhousie University"}], "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 1, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "7570821"}}]}}, "title": "Defectors: A Large Scale Python Dataset for Defect Prediction", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7708984", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/7708984", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/7708984?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7708984", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7708984", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.7708984", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7708984/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7570821", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/7570821", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7570821", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.7570821", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:7708984/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:7708984/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7708984/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7708984/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7708984/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/7708984/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7708984/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7708984/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7708984/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7708984/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7708984/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7708984/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7708984/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7708984/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7708984/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7708984/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7708984/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7708984/quota-increase", "requests": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7708984/requests"}, "updated": "2023-03-09T02:26:43.421330+00:00", "recid": "7708984", "revision": 2, "files": [{"id": "26f5d87c-7e42-427d-bf80-0c3796a3f9b1", "key": "defectors.zip", "size": 2223303371, "checksum": "md5:7d6bab4dd3f12ecd76b8d8a8bc785b13", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7708984/files/defectors.zip/content"}}, {"id": "0df8b7f6-5109-4fac-9d64-eb6c6c746e0e", "key": "bug_inducing_commits.zip", "size": 4258243, "checksum": "md5:3b4816bf81335f94f6187fd976a2a22c", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7708984/files/bug_inducing_commits.zip/content"}}, {"id": "2a216e49-d812-45d0-b98b-d8b753f13a4f", "key": "filtered_bug_inducing_commits.yaml", "size": 3261479, "checksum": "md5:46fa9d902d40ef03c2abf68fef26704c", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7708984/files/filtered_bug_inducing_commits.yaml/content"}}, {"id": "8e0f3fb4-f679-40cc-934c-81b714876e49", "key": "repo_links.yaml", "size": 1468, "checksum": "md5:b52880d82b80d19ec1f7085e7dbe901c", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7708984/files/repo_links.yaml/